---
layout: base.njk
pageType: blog
---
<article class="post">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="inner" lang="{{ lang or 'en' }}">
      {% if lang == 'ja' %}<a class="back" href="/ja/blog/">ブログ一覧に戻る</a>{% else %}<a class="back" href="/blog/">Back to the blog</a>{% endif %}
      <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
      <p class="meta"><time datetime="{{ page.date | isoDate }}">{% if lang == 'ja' %}{{ page.date | jaDate }}{% else %}{{ page.date | readableDate }}{% endif %}</time>
        {% if translation %} · {% if lang == 'ja' %}<a href="{{ translation }}" lang="en">Read in English</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ translation }}" lang="ja">日本語で読む</a>{% endif %}{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="prose">
        {{ content | safe }}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if lang == 'ja' %}
    <p class="cta inner" lang="ja">ロボットの学習データを集めていますか？ HUMI Inspectは動画の品質を自動でチェックします。<a href="/ja/inspect/#pilot">試験導入を相談する</a></p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="cta inner">Collecting robot training video? HUMI Inspect checks every clip for darkness, blur, shake and hands out of frame. <a href="/inspect/#pilot">Request a pilot</a></p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</article>
